# Tooling for the CI lint, type-check and audit jobs. Kept apart from requirements.in on
# purpose: the analyzer's runtime install (install.sh) must not pull in dev tools, and this
# file is not part of checksums.sha256.
#
# Regenerate (also to bump a version) with Python 3.12:
#   pip install pip-tools
#   pip-compile --generate-hashes --strip-extras --output-file=requirements-lint.txt requirements-lint.in
